# 随仓库分发; 严禁用 zcode 官方图标替换(版权, 见 client/BUILD.md)

# internal dev scaffolding (not part of the open-source tree)
.scratch/
docs/
tools/
ref/
AGENTS.md
CONTEXT.md

# os / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/

# zcode 环境自动生成的镜像文件
.zcodeignore
